Declaration query on a filter func(err error) error that drops Is(ErrNotFound) / == ErrDeclined and wraps the rest.
A parameter at the top of a declaration query is documented to become unresolved(depends-on-caller): expect
one such entry carrying the "classified: %w" chain and marked possibly handled by both guards (the callers'
arguments are only substituted in call-site queries, see param_guard_call_*).
-- args --
processor/helper.go:@classify
